            <ArticleTitle>Chronic pain in wounds: a report on 11 case studies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>48-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sylvie Hampton describes the effectiveness of an ibuprofen-impregnated dressing on wound pain. This article describes the outcomes on 11 case studies of patients with painful wounds who were supplied with a new ibuprofen-impregnated dressing (Biatain-Ibu).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
